{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997330/extras/BaruchGreet.gif?t=1746105425\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Curse my Zvon! How\u2019d a bright spark like you land in this forsaken pit, lad?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>No, don\u2019t answer! Baruch knows how to mind his own business!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Baruch knows nothin\u2019 \u2019bout no hallucinatory &quot;Forest&quot; we\u2019re standin\u2019 in.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Baruch knows nothin\u2019 \u2019bout no &quot;Red-Haired Girl&quot; you\u2019re seekin\u2019.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Baruch knows absolutely, <strong><u>absolutely nothin\u2019</u></strong> \u2019bout no cursed &quot;Whirlpool&quot; ya need to trek to.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Baruch buys. Baruch sells. Business!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Now lay your greedy peepers on this unholy box of wonders, lad!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997330/extras/text-gameplay-s.gif?t=1746105425\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>First things first. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>It's clear that you can be trusted with lethal weapons. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>It's clear that you can distinguish friends from foes...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997330/extras/alphon-hit.gif?t=1746105425\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The <strong>Apparatus</strong>! Swap your Zvon for sparks-and-sin bargains! (That\u2019s how real business works, lad.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997330/extras/apparatus-trade.gif?t=1746105425\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You will meet the wisest of this world and be enlightened by their words\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997330/extras/silentio.gif?t=1746105425\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You will wrap yourself in the coziness of sugar-spun fantasies...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997330/extras/sweet-dreams.gif?t=1746105425\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Here, fashion is your profession, lad.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997330/extras/fashion.gif?t=1746105425\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Drown yer bones in eye-meltin\u2019 wonders \u2018n\u2019 serenity-peaceful trails!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997330/extras/traversing.gif?t=1746105425\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>No dangers lurk there...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>No hostility along your peaceful path...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>No nightmares - swear it...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>And absolutely, <strong><u>absolutely no lies</u></strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Mind the word of Baruch! Trust me.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph